+// SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-SA-4.0
+= AffineScript DOM Connector (affinescript-dom)
+:toc: preamble
+
+High-assurance virtual-DOM + reconciler for AffineScript — memory-safe web
+manipulation over opaque host node handles.
+
+== Components
+
+[cols="2,3",options="header"]
+|===
+| Path | Description
+
+| `src/dom.affine`
+| Virtual-DOM (`VNode`), `h()` / `text()` builders, `render()` / `mount()` /
+  `reconcile()` realiser. The canonical, compiling implementation.
+
+| `src/abi/DOM.idr`
+| Idris2 ABI describing the host DOM boundary (dependently-typed contract).
+
+| `ffi/zig/src/main.zig`
+| Zig FFI implementation of the host DOM externs.
+
+| `package.json`
+| Package manifest (`@affinescript/dom`).
+|===
+
+== Licensing
+
+This connector is *Core Technology* — an editor/IDE integration — under the
+repository's licensing policy, *not* AGPL game content. Accordingly:
+
+[cols="1,2",options="header"]
+|===
+| Material | Licence
+
+| Code (`*.affine`, `*.idr`, `*.zig`, `package.json`)
+| *MPL-2.0* — `LICENSES/LICENSE-MPL-2.0`
+
+| Documentation / prose (this README and any docs)
+| *CC-BY-SA-4.0* — `LICENSES/LICENSE-CC-BY-SA-4.0`
+|===
+
+This matches:
+
+* the repository root `LICENSE` (`SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0` +
+  `SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-SA-4.0`);
+* `README.adoc` "License" — "core compiler, tooling, and editor integrations
+  ... MPL-2.0; documentation and prose under CC-BY-SA-4.0";
+* `docs/governance/LICENSING-GUIDE.md` §2 (Core Technology, MPL-2.0 —
+  "Language server and IDE integration").
+
